  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s Center Uzice - Core support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&#x2019;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&quot; the partner organisation Women&apos;s Center Uzice  is recieving core support. With the core funding Women&apos;s Center Uzice is aiming at contributing to the following project outcomes: 
1.Combating gender-based violence and discrimination (Goal: The public is informed about the problem, the legislative framework has been improved and women in situations of gender-based violence receive adequate support) 
2. Development of women&apos;s activism  and solidarity in the community. (Goal :Women from multiple vulnerable groups   receive adequate support thanks to women&apos;s activism, strong organizations and philanthropic contributions from citizens.)</narrative>
  </description>
